The Windows port changes the application frontend and native player, extracts
shared Android/JVM platform protocols, and replaces MediaMP's reduced FFmpeg
DLLs with an ABI-compatible full LGPL build for FLV support. Native dependency
sources themselves are not modified by My Live; upstream MediaMP includes its
own mpv patches and build recipes.
